    Version 3.5.9+ A2 (June 2026).
    Author: software developer (non-specialist).
    AI assistance: developed in conversation with Mavis (M3, MiniMax), disclosed in §1 and supporting/ai_disclosure.md.

    Honest status (v3.5.9+ A2):
    - 16/17 test categories pass, 7/7 specific cases pass
    - 169 honest limitations (144 master + 14 L308af-az)
    - 15 parameters: 1 MEASURED, 3 FIRST-PRINCIPLES, 2 DERIVED, 4 STRUCTURAL, 4 CALIBRATED, 1 FREE
    - M_Pl,4D = 3.93e23 GeV (DERIVED via alpha-GM, L308v)
    - alpha = 1.289 (FIRST-PRINCIPLES via Schwarzian SYK N=12, L308n)
    - eps = 6.32e-34 (A2 recalibrated)
    - gamma_4D = 1.10e+111 (formula uses M_Pl,3D parent reference)
    - tau_3D,apparent = 1.66e+145 yr (A2)
    - f_leak,3D->4D = H_0 (L308ax frame-neutral naming)
    - 0 strongly confirmed, 0 falsified
    - Strong on local physics (RAR 10% fit, AGN p<10^-50, g_+ universal 4.5 decades)
    - Weak on CMB-era physics (Hubble tension unresolved, full Lagrangian requires 2D expert)

    Coordinate-invariant tensor construction in supporting/T_tensor_construction.md.
    Lagrangian attempt in §2.5.1.
    Master limitations table in §7.0.
    591 pages, 1.93 MB.


**L308bi (2026-06-22)**: Framework officially adopts Option B Strengthened (α dim-specific with full first-principles for all three N values via Clifford C(6) SM algebra, Stoica 2018). No numerical changes.
